pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |
  LSTM 模型：图13 内部节点结构；输入 x_t = {SOC, Q, T_e, P_l, C}，输出剩余续驶里程；
  三门结构（遗忘门/输入门/输出门）选择性保留序列信息，缓解长序列梯度消失与爆炸。
elements:
  - elementId: chrome-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 28, 600, 14]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$accent;">03</span><span style="color:$muted;"> / LSTM 剩余续驶里程预测模型</span></p>
  - elementId: chrome-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 46, 780, 32]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: LSTM 结构与模型输入输出
  - elementId: chrome-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 87, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: chrome-rule-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 85, 44, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$accent" }
  - elementId: fig13-plate
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 102, 840, 261]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: fig13
    elementType: image
    bounds: [62, 104, 836, 257]
    src: media/fig13_lstm.jpg
    fit: { mode: contain }
  - elementId: fig13-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 367, 840, 14]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$accent;font-weight:bold;">图 13</span>　LSTM 神经网络内部节点结构：遗忘门、输入门、输出门与细胞状态的时序传递</p>
  - elementId: input-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 390, 400, 16]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Alimama ShuHeiTi"
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$accent"
      wrap: false
      text: t 时刻模型输入
  - elementId: input-formula
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 410, 400, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      text: |
        <p>\(x_t = \{\mathrm{SOC},\ Q,\ T_e,\ P_l,\ C\}\)</p>
  - elementId: input-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 438, 400, 28]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 9.5
      text: |
        <p>依次为电池荷电状态、驾驶行为量化因子、环境温度、电器用电负荷率、速度工况</p>
  - elementId: input-why
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 468, 400, 36]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 9.5
      text: |
        <p>三门结构选择性保留序列信息，有效缓解 RNN 长序列训练中的梯度消失与梯度爆炸，适合时序里程预测</p>
  - elementId: vsep
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [480, 394, 1, 104]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: output-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [504, 390, 396, 16]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Alimama ShuHeiTi"
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$accent"
      wrap: false
      text: t 时刻模型输出与门控
  - elementId: output-formula
    elementType: text
    bounds: [504, 410, 396, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      text: |
        <p>\(h_t = \{剩余续驶里程\}\)</p>
  - elementId: gates
    elementType: text
    bounds: [504, 440, 396, 64]
    content:
      fontSize: 11.5
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.75
      text: |
        <p>遗忘门　\(f_t = \sigma\left(W_f [h_{t-1}, x_t] + b_f\right)\)</p>
        <p>细胞态　\(C_t = f_t C_{t-1} + i_t g_t\)</p>
        <p>输出门　\(h_t = o_t \otimes \tanh(C_t)\)</p>
  - elementId: chrome-foot-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 508, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: chrome-foot-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 514, 700, 16]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      wrap: false
      text: 基于驾驶行为量化特征的电动汽车剩余续驶里程预测 · 《新能源车辆工程学报》
  - elementId: chrome-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [856, 512, 44, 18]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Alimama ShuHeiTi"
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$text"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: "12"
